  "details": "1: Join a (public/friends+) VRChat world instance on \"Green\" status. (Not sure if this invite system works when on \"Orange/Red)\n\n2: Go to Discord and go to a place that allows invites to be sent. (ex. friend's messages)\n\n3: Send an invite to the VRChat instance that you're in through Discord.\n\nWhat should happen: The other users receive the invite and can join that instance with that invite through Discord. All users involved see a valid invite.\n\nWhat actually happens: The other users receive the invite, but is unable to accept it because it shows as an expired invite to those users. The sender only sees the invite as valid.\n\nNow, I know people don't use this feature much, but a bug is a bug is a bug is a bug. :D",
